      "body": "### What\n\nThe COM concept crate uses thiserror::Error derives on its public error enums. The #[error(...)] attributes provide error display messages, and the derive generates the standard error implementations at compile time. The error enums and their variants are part of the Rust COM API.\n\nAcceptance criteria\n\n- Record the pinned crate version, enabled features, and error types using the derive.\n- Review the generated behavior, provenance, license, maintenance status, and safety relevance.\n- Document whether to retain thiserror or implement the required error traits directly.\n- Record the required qualification artifacts and any API or maintenance impact of the decision.\n\n### How\n\n_No response_\n\n### Estimates for realization\n\n_No response_\n\n### Category\n\n- [ ] Affects Detailed Design\n\n### Requirements / Architecture\n\n- [x] Requirements / Architecture are not affected by this change?",
